    "text": "THIS IS AMAZING: James Talarico made a surprise appearance on stage with Kacey Musgraves in Dallas last night, and Texas got to see exactly the kind of candidate he is. The Texas Democratic Senate candidate joined Musgraves at her concert at the American Airlines Center on Saturday night, according to The Dallas Morning News. And the song choice couldn't have been more Texas.",
